 462. 物理引擎-碰撞响应
```starc
Funktion collision_response(obj_a, obj_b)
    if collision_detect(obj_a, obj_b)
        norm = (obj_a.position - obj_b.position) / distanz
        relativ_geschw = obj_a.velocity - obj_b.velocity
        impulse = dot(relativ_geschw, norm) / (1/obj_a.mass + 1/obj_b.mass)
        obj_a.velocity = obj_a.velocity - impulse / obj_a.mass * norm
        obj_b.velocity = obj_b.velocity + impulse / obj_b.mass * norm
        Ausgeben "碰撞响应计算完成"
        gebe_zurueck [obj_a, obj_b]
    Ende Wenn
Ende Funktion
```
